+## Trade-offs
+
+- The in-memory dedupe set holds every `meta_id` from start to stop, so its size grows with the run (MF-8). One hour of replay is small. A long live run has no bound, and no test measures the growth.
+- Keeping the run open until `DURATION` (B-1) makes a replay without HTTP 204 cost a full `DURATION` per comparison run (C-2). That is the price of the spec's "consumes the stream for that long".
+- Excluding the eight 2021-vintage Connecticut counties from check 2 keeps two geographies apart. It also drops those counties from the ranking. On this data the top ten does not change (C-5).
+- Recipient location is the place rule (G-3). It is a defensible choice, and the decision records it.
