+Vibe-test verdict: NOT READY FOR PLANNING, with blocking gaps G-1 to G-4. This plan does not wait for
+the spec to change. Each blocking gap is settled by an assumption (see "Blocking gaps and assumptions").
+Each assumption has a decision record under `.context/proposals/` and a row in the register
+`.context/deferrals/cd-1_deferral-register.md`.
